{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:47cece2a92e3bf8e80be540cc6f07ab4afe78c4ba9e6d001c112f76ff16b50e7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bd069ed8605967e245b490ef0a307275f0e32a0282591b4c5689c64da712e00",
      "text": "阁下，感谢你抽空相见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7658bf5dfdec92a28f19b6856e794dee7eaca54a4a957cf0db065e58dbdcfe8c",
      "text": "希望你能收下这个。\n这是白色情人节的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b257d46160c1804f02f61c6113625220c2bd16c14e32d29ed50726f769864c8b",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n……感觉挺有分量的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd10bdeb3de7fbfd11d98976c61076b232206b75f0205791373d819c0ad6c468",
      "text": "嗯，里面装着用马蹄铁制成的摆件。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f319a44badf5d03168fbbb91d93ba4dfa4937ad56536e030b070b759d0d6aa1",
      "text": "因为人们常说，\n马蹄铁能给拥有者带来幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70b49950106cd203af72a2c114d405cc9afdf39cb674010b882d213fd2c0dea6",
      "text": "饱含着愿阁下常伴幸运的祈愿，\n我挑选了此物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69f05f106967f15f8e33eb69630bbe00020bde0b23529aac611c8a07118c7da6",
      "text": "不嫌弃的话，请装饰在家中的某处吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5e2dbf7ba3a24633947bb05cf7b1f5f6e8830625e9aa8fb2caa4648ac888c88",
      "text": "好的，我会好好珍视摆放起来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbd2aee11a8c0b080f971d4ad175ad8aaf5307af99cc97de6bafb083d1eedfd6",
      "text": "……从前，我曾与阁下\n一同去观赏过骏马吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40a40ec0fc2401c47d21b5ef4c93d78b0cac0c9bd10cd380373bd6e3d77e0346",
      "text": "那一天的景象我至今仍难以忘怀。\n选择马蹄铁，这也是很大的原因。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_23_5_02_008_23:5_02_008_23:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2b6b6a4a069cea60ff07dbbd1973b69bc0189f809dc6c6b87bce13385d1746f",
      "text": "倘若今后还能与我一同\n去看马的话，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
